            },
            // STEP 3: 1.2 Why Use Drivers? -> Benefits
            { 
                title: "Topic 1.2: Benefits of the GoodBlock Approach", 
                body: `<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-gray-700">
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold mb-1" style="color: var(--brand-secondary);">Tangible Results</p>
                            <p>Every lesson guarantees a measurable, visible output you can use right away (a draft, a formula, a deleted file).</p>
