                        </div>
                    </div>`,
            },
            // STEP 4: Topic 2.1: Locating the Setup Screen - Accordions with generic text/image
            { 
                title: "Topic 2.1: Locating the Core Action Point", 
                body: `<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Every effective action starts with an honest assessment of the problem. We call this the **[Check-In]** phase. Expand the sections below for details on how to diagnose where to start.</p>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <!-- ACCORDION 1: Diagnosis -->
                            <div class="goodblock-card p-4">
                                <button class="accordion-header flex justify-between w-full text-left items-center" data-target="step4-content-1">
                                    <div>
                                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-0" style="color: var(--brand-secondary);">Diagnosis: Finding the Starting Point</h4>
